    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Cursedland! It's a blood-pumping, action-filled platformer experience bursting to the brim with humor, chaos, and memes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is an original title where every jump and step is part of the experience. In Cursedland, you will maneuver floating platforms, dodge traps, and stomp on enemies only to encounter a surreal world full of hilarious and demanding surprises. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to flee the cursed realm. Rely on your precision and reflexes and shield that mask from the corrupting power of Cursedland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action on classic platforming concepts with an added zest of humor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three levels to play and veil up a gruesome mix of challenges to test anyone\u2019s skill set for demo purposes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies with attack patterns that you will need to master to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An artistic and retro aesthetic fused with a modern twist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but precise controls that fully complement the sophisticated level designs with a mix of strategy and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447170/extras/4f514ac392a3a7da37278360d20d4969.avif?t=1747376542\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447170/extras/699e40b1be5d81202b148f67bbb76fac.avif?t=1747376542\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447170/extras/b5291d8308e2823fe05fc48bcccf0a62.avif?t=1747376542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
